OL,5,
OL,6,CG1985FMembers of the National Union of
OL,7,FJournalists at the BBC stage a 24-hour
OL,8,Fwalkout over a ban on the transmission
OL,9,Fof a Real Lives documentary by the BBC
OL,10,FBoard of Governors. The ban was
OL,11,Fregarded by the union as government
OL,12,Fcensorship.
OL,13,
OL,14,FNews programming on BBC TV and radio
OL,15,Fwas blacked out. Journalists at TV-am,
OL,16,FITN and some ITV regional companies
OL,17,Fjoined the strike action.
